
### 1. Get all students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

###

### 2. Get skills for student ID 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/skills

###

### 3. Add Java skill
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Java",
  "proficiencyLevel": "Intermediate"
}

###

### 4. Add SQL skill
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "SQL",
  "proficiencyLevel": "Beginner"
}

###

### 5. Update skill ID 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/skills/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Java",
  "proficiencyLevel": "Advanced"
}

###

### 6. Delete skill ID 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/skills/1

###
